{
  "$comment": "Experiment 4 (entanglement, Bell state) equations E1-E13 transcribed from docs/content/05-experiment-4-entanglement.md, plus check-in helpers the site implies but does not print (two_particle_list, product_expand, not_a_product, alpha_basis, polarizer_general, cos_shift, cos_diff_identity, cos_diff_as_overlap, singles_flat) and three lab helpers that are NOT on the site (unbalanced_pair, pump_hwp, phi_minus_coincidence). Site convention: photon 1 -> P1 at beta, photon 2 -> P2 at alpha. Rendered by tools/mathgen into app/assets/math/exp4/. \\ket, \\bra, \\braket, \\diag, \\antidiag, \\lost, \\H, \\V are built into mathgen.",
